(text "RMX A0.2 / POWER / DRAFT - regulated external 12V DC, center positive, current-limited 2A source; NO mains circuitry in chassis" (at 15 13 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 7f2a8c11-07fa-5d63-a53e-7a50de1a4199))
(text "Two ISOLATED 24V modules create separate raw positive and negative rails; their output returns are bonded at GND." (at 15 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid e22249e6-aa1a-5b0b-a4e9-6881ae5172ca))
(text "LDOs reduce raw +/-24V to approximately +/-20V. Never connect raw rails to U28. Use rated capacitors with guaranteed effective capacitance." (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 81032170-263a-5da9-872d-2a9f6fe382ca))
(text "+3V3 is supplied by Seed pin 38, not an external parallel regulator. Measure available rail current, temperature and startup before attaching controls." (at 15 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 22cc67cc-cb61-5240-9baf-7a27193b75d2))
